name: Link Analysis ownership showcase
tagline: "A seeded beneficial-ownership and sanctions Link Analysis demo - a hidden owner behind a 5-layer chain, a sanctioned person two hops from a customer, a nominee director of 120 companies and a circle of companies paying each other, planted among 6 000 companies and 5 000 people with benign look-alikes"
description: "The KYC and sanctions-compliance Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier. Seven synthetic feeds (company, person, ownership, officer, customer, payment, sanctions_list; a register snapshot and 12 months of payments from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, October 2026 and 8 new customers in data/staged; 6 000 companies, 5 000 people, 1 500 bank customers, about 40 000 payments and an INVENTED sanctions list of 400 people) are landed by seven Collectors and Pipelines. The ownership_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, percent, score, event_date, via) of five link kinds: owns, officer_of, customer_is, paid and name_match, a fuzzy match to the list (DuckDB jaro_winkler_similarity at 0.90 or above with the same birth year and nationality). Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-ownership-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by OwnershipLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-ownership-data.test.mjs): one person reaches 4 customers through a 5-layer chain across Cyprus, the British Virgin Islands and the UAE with every stake at 24 %, ending in 61 % of each customer; a customer's 50 % owner is 60 % owned by a person who matches a listed person; one person directs 120 companies at one formation-agent address; three companies own each other in a circle and pay each other round it every month. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a listed company with widely held shares, a near-namesake of a listed person with a different birth year and nationality, an accountant directing 4 family firms, and a group with a clear parent. Four saved views, one per story. Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only; no name on the sanctions list is real."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:building-office-2
contents[5]: "7 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (register snapshot, 12 months of payments landed, 1 month staged)", "ownership_links Job + Dataset (5 link kinds, percent, score, via)", "name_match by Jaro-Winkler against an invented sanctions list", "4 saved views (hidden owner, sanctions path, nominee director, circular ownership)", "4 planted stories with benign look-alikes"
